---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy — Tayo Na"
  description="Tayo Na privacy policy — what we collect, why, and how to contact us."
>
  <div class="container page">
    <header class="page-header">
      <a href="/" class="back-link">← Back</a>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="last-updated">Last updated: June 26, 2026</p>
    </header>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>Who we are</h2>
      <p>
        Tayo Na is a mobile-first travel planning app available at
        <a href="https://tayona.app">tayona.app</a>. Questions or concerns? Email us at
        <a href="mailto:support@tayona.app">support@tayona.app</a>.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>What we collect and why</h2>

      <div class="item">
        <h3>Account information</h3>
        <p>
          When you sign in, we collect your email address. We use it solely to authenticate you via a
          magic link or one-time code. We do not store passwords.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="item">
        <h3>Trip data</h3>
        <p>
          If you use premium features, your trip data — including destinations, itinerary events,
          group members, and expenses — is stored in our cloud database (Supabase, hosted in the US).
          Free-tier users store trip data locally on their device only.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="item">
        <h3>Usage analytics</h3>
        <p>
          We use PostHog to collect anonymous usage data, including which features you use, how you
          interact with the app, and your IP address. This helps us understand how the app is used
          and improve it. We do not sell this data. Session recordings are collected with all text
          inputs masked.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>What we don't collect</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Passwords</li>
        <li>Payment information (handled entirely by our payment processor)</li>
        <li>Any data from your contacts, camera, or files unless you explicitly provide it</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>Data retention</h2>
      <p>
        We retain your data for as long as your account is active. You can delete your account and
        all associated data at any time from the Profile screen. You may also request deletion by
        emailing <a href="mailto:support@tayona.app">support@tayona.app</a>.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>Third-party services</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <a href="https://supabase.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Supabase</a> — database and
          authentication
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://posthog.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">PostHog</a> — analytics
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://lemonsqueezy.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Lemon Squeezy</a> —
          payment processing (coming soon)
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://cloudflare.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Cloudflare</a> — hosting
          and content delivery
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        You may request access to, correction of, or deletion of your personal data at any time by
        emailing <a href="mailto:support@tayona.app">support@tayona.app</a> or using the delete
        account option in the Profile screen.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
      <p>
        We may update this policy as the app evolves. We'll note the date of the last update at the
        top of this page.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p><a href="mailto:support@tayona.app">support@tayona.app</a></p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page {
    padding-top: 4rem;
    padding-bottom: 5rem;
    max-width: 720px;
  }

  .page-header {
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .back-link {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .back-link:hover {
    color: var(--primary);
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: 2.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .last-updated {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .section {
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    color: var(--primary);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  h3 {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
  }

  p {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .item {
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .item h3 {
    color: var(--text);
  }

  ul {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  ul li {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    position: relative;
  }

  ul li::before {
    content: '—';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--primary);
  }
</style>
